<title>VENEZUELA: SOCCER-VENEZUELA AND BOLIVIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VENEZUELA AND BOLIVIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VALERA, Venezuela 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela and Bolivia drew 1-1 (halftime 0-0) in World Cup South American group qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers;</p>
<p>Venezuela - Giovanni Savarese 63</p>
<p>Bolivia - Ramiro Castillo 73</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
</text>
